<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">II Pierre</para>
  <para style="toc1">II PIERRE</para>
  <para style="toc2">II Pierre</para>
  <para style="toc3">II Pi</para>
  <para style="mt1">II PIERRE</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1"/>Simon Pierre, yon sèvitè-atache nèt, e apòt a Jésus Kri, a sila ki te resevwa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:12">Wo 1:12</ref></char></note>yon lafwa menm jan ak nou yo, pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:21-26">Wo 3:21-26</ref></char></note>ladwati Bondye ak Sovè nou an, Jésus Kri: <verse eid="2PE 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2"/>Ke lagras ak lapè vin miltipliye a nou menm nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:3">Jn 17:3</ref></char></note>konesans a Bondye ak Jésus, Senyè nou an, <verse eid="2PE 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3"/>akoz nou wè ke pwisans diven Li an bannou tout bagay ki apatyen a lavi ak sentete, atravè vrè konesans a Li, ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 2:12">I Tes 2:12</ref></char></note>rele nou pa pwòp glwa ak ekselans Li. <verse eid="2PE 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4"/>Paske pa sila yo, Li te bannou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 3:9">II Pi 3:9</ref>,<ref loc="2PE 3:13">13</ref></char></note>pwomès presye e manyifik Li, pouke nan yo, nou ta kapab vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 3:2">I Jn 3:2</ref></char></note>patisipan nan nati sen an, e chape de koripsyon ki nan mond lan pa konvwatiz lachè a.<verse eid="2PE 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5"/>Alò, pou rezon sa a tou, avèk tout dilijans nan lafwa nou, mete ekselans moral, e nan ekselans moral nou, mete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:3">Kol 2:3</ref></char></note>konesans. <verse eid="2PE 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6"/>Sou konesans nou, mete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 24:25">Trav 24:25</ref></char></note>bon kontwòl tèt nou, e nan bon kontwòl tèt nou, mete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:19">Luc 21:19</ref></char></note>pèseverans, e nan pèseverans nou, mete sentete. <verse eid="2PE 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7"/>Anplis nan sentete nou, mete bonte fratènèl, e nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:10">Wo 12:10</ref></char></note>bonte fratènèl nou, mete lanmou.<verse eid="2PE 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8"/>Paske si kalite sa yo nan nou e ap ogmante, yo p ap rann nou ni initil, ni <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:10">Kol 1:10</ref></char></note>san fwi nan vrè konesans Senyè nou an, Jésus Kri. <verse eid="2PE 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9"/>Paske, sila ki manke kalite sa yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:11">I Jn 2:11</ref></char></note>avèg oswa pa wè klè, akoz li bliye ke li te netwaye de ansyen peche li yo.<verse eid="2PE 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10"/>Konsa, frè m yo, se pou nou vin pi dilijan pou fè sèten de <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:29">Wo 11:29</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 1:4">I Tes 1:4</ref></char></note>chwa ak apèl Li de nou menm nan. Paske otan ke n ap pratike bagay sa yo, nou p ap janm glise tonbe. <verse eid="2PE 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11"/>Paske lè nou aji nan fason sa a, antre nan wayòm etènèl Senyè ak Sovè nou an, Jésus Kri, va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:4">Wo 2:4</ref></char></note>toujou disponib a nou menm an abondans.<verse eid="2PE 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12"/>Konsa, mwen va toujou prè pou fè nou sonje bagay sa yo, malgre nou deja konnen yo, e etabli nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:5">Kol 1:5</ref></char></note>verite ki deja la avèk nou an. <verse eid="2PE 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13"/>Paske mwen konsidere li bon, toutotan mwen ap demere nan kay tèrès sila a, pou vire memwa nou pou fè nou sonje, <verse eid="2PE 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14"/>avèk konesans ke moman pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:6">II Tim 4:6</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 21:19">Jn 21:19</ref></char></note>mete akote kay tèrès mwen an toupre kòm osi Jésus Kri te fè m byen konprann nan. <verse eid="2PE 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15"/>Konsa, mwen va osi fè dilijans pou nenpòt lè m <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 9:31">Luc 9:31</ref></char></note>fin ale, nou kapab toujou sonje bagay sa yo.<verse eid="2PE 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16"/>Paske nou pa t swiv <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 1:4">I Tim 1:4</ref></char></note>vye listwa koken lè nou te fè nou konnen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 13:26">Mc 13:26</ref></char></note>pwisans ak retou a Senyè nou an, Jésus Kri, men zye nou te temwen majeste Li. <verse eid="2PE 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17"/>Paske, lè Li te resevwa laglwa ak lonè Bondye, Papa a, yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:5">Mat 17:5</ref></char></note>pawòl konsa te fèt a Li pa Laglwa Majeste a: “Sa se Fis byeneme Mwen an; avèk Li, Mwen byen kontan.” <verse eid="2PE 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18"/>Epi nou menm te tande pawòl sa yo, fèt depi nan syèl la, lè nou te avèk Li sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:5">Egz 3:5</ref></char></note>mòn sen an.<verse eid="2PE 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19"/>Konsa, nou gen pawòl pwofesi yo fèt pi asire. A sila nou dwe prete atansyon an tankou se yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 119:105">Sòm 119:105</ref></char></note>lanp k ap klere yon kote ki fènwa, jiskaske bajou kase e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:16">Rev 22:16</ref></char></note>zetwal granmmaten an leve nan kè nou.<verse eid="2PE 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20"/>Men konnen sa davans, ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:6">Wo 12:6</ref></char></note>nanpwen pwofesi nan lekriti sen an ki sijè a pwòp entèpretasyon prive. <verse eid="2PE 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:26">Jr 23:26</ref></char></note>okenn pwofesi pa t janm fèt pa volonte a moun, men lèzòm, dirije pa Lespri Sen an te pale pawòl yo ki te soti nan Bondye.<verse eid="2PE 1:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 13:1">Det 13:1</ref></char></note>fo pwofèt yo te osi leve pami pèp la. Menmjan an, va gen fo enstriktè pami nou tou, ki va entwodwi an sekrè fo doktrin destriktif yo, ki menm nye Mèt la ki te ransonnen yo a, e yo pote destriksyon rapid sou tèt yo. <verse eid="2PE 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2"/>Anpil va swiv <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:5">Jen 19:5</ref></char></note>vi sansyèl yo, e akoz de yo, chemen laverite a va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:24">Wo 2:24</ref></char></note>meprize. <verse eid="2PE 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3"/>Epi nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 6:5">I Tim 6:5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:35">Det 32:35</ref></char></note>vorasite yo, yo va eksplwate nou avèk fo pawòl, men jijman a yo menm ki te prepare depi nan tan lontan an p ap mize, e destriksyon yo p ap dòmi. <verse eid="2PE 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JUD 1:6">Jd 1:6</ref></char></note>si Bondye pa t epagne zanj yo lè yo te peche a, men te voye yo nan labim tenèb ki te rezève pou jijman an; <verse eid="2PE 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5"/>epi pa t epagne <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:20">Egz 26:20</ref></char></note>ansyen mond lan, men te prezève Noé, yon predikatè ladwati, avèk sèt lòt, lè Li te voye yon delij sou mond konwonpi a, <verse eid="2PE 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6"/>epi si Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24">Jen 19:24</ref></char></note>kondane vil Sodome ak Gomorrhe pou destriksyon e te redwi yo an sann, epi te fè yo yon egzanp pou sila ki ta vin mennen yon vi san Bondye pi devan yo; <verse eid="2PE 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7"/>epi si li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24">Jen 19:24</ref></char></note>delivre Lot ki te yon nonm ladwati, oprime pa sansyalite a mesye san prensip yo, <verse eid="2PE 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8"/>(paske pa sa ke li te wè e tande <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:4">Eb 11:4</ref></char></note>nonm ladwati sila a, pandan li t ap viv pami yo, te santi nanm dwat li a te toumante jou apre jou pa zèv san règ ni lwa yo.) <verse eid="2PE 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:13">I Kor 10:13</ref></char></note>Alò Senyè a konnen kijan pou Li delivre moun Li yo de tantasyon, e pou kenbe mechan an anba pinisyon pou jou jijman an. <verse eid="2PE 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10"/>Sitou sila ki satisfè lachè a nan dezi konwonpi li yo, e ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:28">Egz 22:28</ref></char></note>meprize otorite. Plen kouraj e awogan, yo pa menm tranble lè yo ensilte zanj majeste yo, <verse eid="2PE 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JUD 1:9">Jd 9</ref></char></note>malgre zanj ki pi gran an pwisans ak pouvwa yo pa janm pote yon move jijman kont yo devan Senyè a. <verse eid="2PE 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JUD 1:10">Jd 10</ref></char></note>sa yo, tankou bèt san rezon, fèt tankou kreyati ki aji san refleksyon, ki fèt pou kapte e touye, ki mal pale kote yo pa gen konesans, va osi detwi nan destriksyon a kreyati sila yo.<verse eid="2PE 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13"/>Y ap soufri mal kòm salè a mal ke yo fè. Se plezi yo pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 13:13">Wo 13:13</ref></char></note>fè banbòch an plèn joune. Se tach ak salte, k ap fè kè kontan nan desepsyon yo, pandan y ap fete avèk nou. <verse eid="2PE 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14"/>Ak zye plen adiltè ki pa janm sispann fè peche, yo sedwi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 1:8">Jc 1:8</ref></char></note>nanm ki pa stab yo. Kè yo ki antrene pou lanvi tout bagay, se pitit madichon yo ye. <verse eid="2PE 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15"/>Nan abandone <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:10">Trav 13:10</ref></char></note>bon chemen an, yo vin egare pou swiv <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:5">Nonb 22:5</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 22:7">7</ref></char></note>chemen Balaam, fis Bosor a, ki te renmen salè inikite yo. <verse eid="2PE 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16"/>Men li te resevwa yon repwòch pou pwòp transgresyon li. Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:21">Nonb 22:21</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 22:23">23</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 22:28">28</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 22:30">30</ref></char></note>yon bourik bèbè te pale avèk vwa yon moun, e te mete fren a foli a pwofèt la.<verse eid="2PE 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17"/>Sa yo se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JUD 1:12">Jd 12</ref></char></note>sous san dlo e nyaj ki pouse pa yon van tanpèt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JUD 1:13">Jd 13</ref></char></note>pou sila tenèb fènwa fin rezève nèt la. <verse eid="2PE 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18"/>Paske nan pale fò avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JUD 1:16">Jd 16</ref></char></note>awogans ak vanite, yo sedwi pa dezi lachè yo, pa sansyalite, atake sila ki prèske pa gen fòs yo pou chape devan sila ki viv nan erè yo, <verse eid="2PE 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19"/>k ap pwomèt yo libète, pandan yo menm se esklav a koripsyon; paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:34">Jn 8:34</ref></char></note>sa ki domine yon moun, fè l vin esklav.<verse eid="2PE 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20"/>Paske si, apre yo fin chape de tout bagay sal mond sa a pa konesans Senyè ak Sovè a Jésus Kri, yo bwouye ladan yo ankò e vin simonte <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:45">Mat 12:45</ref></char></note>dènye eta yo a vin pi mal pase premye a. <verse eid="2PE 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 18:24">Éz 18:24</ref></char></note>Paske li ta pi bon pou yo pa t konnen chemen ladwati a, olye yo vin konnen l, pou vire kite kòmandman sen ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JUD 1:3">Jd 3</ref></char></note>livre a yo menm nan. <verse eid="2PE 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22"/>Men sa ki vin rive a yo menm selon vrè pwovèb la: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 26:11">Pwov 26:11</ref></char></note>“Yon chen retounen a pwòp vomisman l” epi “gwo manman kochon an, lè l fin benye, li retounen woule kò l nan labou a.”<verse eid="2PE 2:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1"/>Sa se koulye a, byeneme yo, dezyèm lèt ke m ekri nou an. Ladann mwen ap eseye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 1:13">II Pi 1:13</ref></char></note>kiltive nan nou kèk refleksyon serye, pou fè nou sonje, <verse eid="2PE 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2"/>pou nou kab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JUD 1:17">Jd 17</ref></char></note>sonje pawòl ki te pale oparavan pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:70">Luc 1:70</ref></char></note>pwofèt sen yo e kòmandman a Senyè ak Sovè a ki te pale pa apot nou yo.<verse eid="2PE 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3"/>Konnen sa dabò, ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 4:1">I Tim 4:1</ref></char></note>nan dènye jou yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JUD 1:18">Jd 18</ref></char></note>mokè yo va vin moke, sila k ap swiv pwòp dezi lachè yo, <verse eid="2PE 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4"/>epi yo va di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 2:17">Mal 2:17</ref></char></note>“Kote pwomès ke L ap vini an? Paske depi papa nou yo te vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:60">Trav 7:60</ref></char></note>mouri, tout bagay kontinye jis jan li te ye depi kòmansman kreyasyon an.”<verse eid="2PE 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5"/>Paske lè yo kalkile konsa a, sa vin chape de remak yo ke selon pawòl Bondye a, syèl yo te egziste depi lontan e latè te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 24:2">Sòm 24:2</ref></char></note>fòme avèk dlo e pa dlo. <verse eid="2PE 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6"/>Pa dlo sa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 2:5">II Pi 2:5</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 7:11">Jen 7:11</ref></char></note>mond lan te detwi, lè l vin kouvri avèk dlo. <verse eid="2PE 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7"/>Men, pa pawòl Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 3:10">II Pi 3:10</ref>,<ref loc="2PE 3:12">12</ref></char></note>syèl avèk tè ki la koulye a, ap rezève pou destriksyon avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:15">És 66:15</ref></char></note>dife, yo kenbe pou jou jijman an ak destriksyon moun mechan yo.<verse eid="2PE 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8"/>Men pa kite sa chape de atansyon nou, byeneme yo, ke avèk Senyè a, yon jou se tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 90:4">Sòm 90:4</ref></char></note>mil ane, e mil ane se tankou yon jou. <verse eid="2PE 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 2:3">Hab 2:3</ref></char></note>Senyè a pa lan sou pwomès Li, jan kèk moun ta konte sa a, men Li pasyan anvè nou, e Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 2:4">I Tim 2:4</ref></char></note>pa vle pou okenn moun ta peri, men pou tout ta vini a larepantans.<verse eid="2PE 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:8">I Kor 1:8</ref></char></note>jou a Senyè a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 5:2">I Tes 5:2</ref></char></note>va vini kòm yon vòlè. Konsa syèl la va disparèt avèk yon gwo bwi, eleman yo va detwi avèk yon gwo chalè, e latè ak zèv li yo va vin brile nèt.<verse eid="2PE 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11"/>Akoz ke tout bagay sa yo dwe detwi nan jan sa a, ki kalite moun nou ta dwe ye selon kondwit ki sen e fidèl? <verse eid="2PE 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12"/>Moun k ap chache toujou pou avanse jou a Bondye, k ap fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 3:7">II Pi 3:7</ref>,<ref loc="2PE 3:10">10</ref></char></note>syèl yo detwi avèk dife, e tout eleman yo fann avèk gwo chalè a! <verse eid="2PE 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13"/>Men selon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:17">És 65:17</ref></char></note>pwomès Li, n ap chache <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:21">Wo 8:21</ref></char></note>syèl ki tounèf yo ak yon tè tounèf, kote ladwati abite.<verse eid="2PE 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14"/>Konsa, byeneme yo, akoz ke n ap chache bagay sa yo, se pou nou dilijan pou Li jwenn nou anpè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:15">Fil 2:15</ref></char></note>san tach e san fot. <verse eid="2PE 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15"/>Konsidere <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 3:9">II Pi 3:9</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:25">Trav 15:25</ref></char></note>pasyans a Senyè a kòm sali nou. Menmjan an osi ak frè byeneme nou an, Paul, te ekri nou, selon sajès ke li te resevwa a, <verse eid="2PE 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16"/>kòm osi nan tout lèt li yo, li te pale ak yo de bagay sa yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 5:11">Eb 5:11</ref></char></note>Ladan yo, gen kèk bagay ki difisil pou konprann, ke sila ki san konprann e ki pa stab yo defòme, jan yo te fè osi ak tout lòt Ekriti sen yo, ki va gen kòm rezilta, pwòp destriksyon pa yo.<verse eid="2PE 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17"/>Konsa, nou menm, byeneme yo, ki konnen sa davans, rete vijilan pou nou pa pote ale pa erè a moun san prensip yo, e tonbe kite pwòp fidelite nou. <verse eid="2PE 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18"/>Men grandi nan lagras ak konesans <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 2:2">II Pi 2:2</ref></char></note>Senyè ak Sovè nou an, Jésus Kri.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 3:18">A Li menm, laglwa, menm koulye a, e nan jou letènite a. Amen.<verse eid="2PE 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3"/>
</usx>
